  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 08 01 03 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 9E 05}哦、哦！\n包在我身上！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_271.bf.json:19:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_018",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0C 01 0B 01 03 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 83 08}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 0A 01}确实很可靠啊。\n从各种意义上说……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_271.bf.json:20:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_019",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F4 87 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 86 07 01 02 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 86 0F 01 0D 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 F0 0A}总、总之，\n我们先做好充分准备吧。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_271.bf.json:21:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_020",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 07 01 05 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}一路走到这里，\n真的太不容易了。\n得把能做的都做了才行！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_271.bf.json:22:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_021",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 05 01 03 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 6E 03}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 08 01}没错！\n豪华装备，豪华补给！！\n再加上肉就完美了！！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_271.bf.json:23:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_022",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 12 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 A9 0C}汪！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_271.bf.json:24:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_023",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 05 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 7F 03}哦，小虎你懂啊！\n你真是个聪明孩子！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_271.bf.json:25:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_024",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0C 01 01 01 01 01 07 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 84 08}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 0A 01}光靠一个“肉”字就和狗沟通了……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_271.bf.json:26:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_025",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 05 01 0D 01 04 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 83 03}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 07 01}那边的你！\n可别小看肉的潜力，\n千万别小看！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_271.bf.json:27:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_026",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F4 87 0E 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 86 11 01 07 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 05 01}肉的潜力……？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_271.bf.json:28:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_027",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 11 01 02 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 86 05 01 02 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 86 10 01 0D 01 01 01 05 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}食用肉的主要成分是水，\n此外还包含蛋白质、脂肪、矿物质\n和维生素等。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_271.bf.json:28:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_027",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}尤其是……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_271.bf.json:29:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_028",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞埃癸斯的讲解滔滔不绝……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_271.bf.json:30:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_029",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 05 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 7F 03}对对，也就是说……\n只要有肉，什么都能做到！\n不接受异议！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_271.bf.json:31:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_030",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0C 01 07 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 88 08}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 0A 01}什么情况，这是小号真田吗？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_271.bf.json:32:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_031",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0F 01 09 01 02 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 F1 0A}没、没事啦！\n千枝又不会\n随身带着蛋白棒……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_271.bf.json:33:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_032",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 07 01 0F 01 02 01 05 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 E5 04}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 0A 01}不过我带着肉味口香糖……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_271.bf.json:34:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_033",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F4 87 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 86 05 01 02 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 86 11 01 07 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 2B 0C}那个……\n能……能长高吗……？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_271.bf.json:35:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_034",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0C 01 05 01 01 01 05 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 89 11}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 0B 01}天田！\n别走上那条路啊！！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_271.bf.json:36:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_035",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 05 01 03 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 7D 03}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 08 01}肉会实现你的一切愿望！！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_271.bf.json:37:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_036",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞伙伴们尽情嬉闹着，\n　似乎在珍惜这最后的时光……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_271.bf.json:38:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_037",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F4 87 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 86 07 01 02 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 86 0F 01 03 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 48 0B}呵呵，千枝真厉害。\n一下就让气氛活跃起来了。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_271.bf.json:39:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_038",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 07 01 05 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}顺平不也是这样吗？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_271.bf.json:40:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_039",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0F 01 09 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}嗯……\n我一直很感谢他。\n不只是顺平，还有大家。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_271.bf.json:40:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_039",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0F 01 0F 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}因为有大家在，我才能努力，\n才能快乐，痛苦也能减半。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_271.bf.json:40:2",
  "message_id": "MSG_039",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}发现“原来自己是这样的人”，\n也总是在和大家相处的时候。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_271.bf.json:40:3",
  "message_id": "MSG_039",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}我从大家那里得到了好多东西……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_271.bf.json:41:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_040",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 07 01 05 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 D8 04}我想，每个人都在用\n各自不同的方式，支持着大家。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_271.bf.json:42:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_041",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0F 01 09 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 48 0B}嗯……是呢。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_271.bf.json:43:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_042",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 07 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}所以，我现在很高兴。\n我最喜欢的人们，\n得到了新伙伴的认可。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_271.bf.json:43:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_042",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 07 01 03 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 F6 04}而且，我也变得\n同样喜欢这些新伙伴了！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_271.bf.json:44:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_043",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0F 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}理世……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_271.bf.json:45:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_044",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 05 01 0D 01 04 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 82 03}喂，那边！\n别把我们排除在外啊！！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_271.bf.json:46:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_045",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0C 01 05 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 0B 01}就是，别把我丢给\n这头肉食猛兽不管啊！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_271.bf.json:47:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_046",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 05 01 03 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 83 03}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 03 01}谁是肉食猛兽啊！！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_271.bf.json:48:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_047",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 12 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 AC 0C}汪。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_271.bf.json:49:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_048",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 10 01 0D 01 01 01 05 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 7B 0B}看来连虎狼丸\n也甘拜千枝下风。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_271.bf.json:50:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_049",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 05 01 0C 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 6A 03}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}你说什么！？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_271.bf.json:51:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_050",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞大家脸上洋溢着笑容……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_271.bf.json:51:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_050",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞感受到了牢固的羁绊……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_271.bf.json:52:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_051",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F4 87 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 86 02 01 02 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 86 07 01 0D 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 F6 04}走吧，学长。\n玲不在这里，\n果然还是太寂寞了。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
